== (e) constant-quiddity strips: orbit of e1 under g = [[a,-1],[1,0]] on P^1(F_p) ==
  p=7: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 4] (max 4 = (p+1)/2 = 4), SL2 orders [4, 8], PSL2 orders [2, 4]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [7] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 3 (<= (p-1)/2 = 3)
  p=11: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 3, 6] (max 6 = (p+1)/2 = 6), SL2 orders [3, 4, 6, 12], PSL2 orders [2, 3, 6]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [11] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 5 (<= (p-1)/2 = 5)
  p=19: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 5, 10] (max 10 = (p+1)/2 = 10), SL2 orders [4, 5, 10, 20], PSL2 orders [2, 5, 10]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [19] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 9 (<= (p-1)/2 = 9)
  p=23: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 3, 4, 6, 12] (max 12 = (p+1)/2 = 12), SL2 orders [3, 4, 6, 8, 12, 24], PSL2 orders [2, 3, 4, 6, 12]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [23] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 11 (<= (p-1)/2 = 11)
  p=31: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 4, 8, 16] (max 16 = (p+1)/2 = 16), SL2 orders [4, 8, 16, 32], PSL2 orders [2, 4, 8, 16]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [31] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 15 (<= (p-1)/2 = 15)
  p=43: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 11, 22] (max 22 = (p+1)/2 = 22), SL2 orders [4, 11, 22, 44], PSL2 orders [2, 11, 22]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [43] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 21 (<= (p-1)/2 = 21)
  p=47: elliptic a: orbit sizes [2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12, 24] (max 24 = (p+1)/2 = 24), SL2 orders [3, 4, 6, 8, 12, 16, 24, 48], PSL2 orders [2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12, 24]; parabolic a=+-2: orbit [47] (= p, not (p+1)/2); hyperbolic max orbit 23 (<= (p-1)/2 = 23)
  CONFIRMED: quiddity a = -2 (parabolic) gives a CLOSED SL2 frieze of width p-3 through p of the p+1 points, whose Legendre pattern is switching-isomorphic to QR_p itself (all p = 3 mod 4, 7 <= p <= 131)
  CONFIRMED: elliptic torus of SL2(F_p) has order p+1, image (p+1)/2 in PSL2 (p = 7, 11, 19, 23)
